# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Survey pagkatapos ng kurso {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"General formulation of quantum information\" course by IBM&reg;! Please take a moment to help us improve our course by filling out the following [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Your feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. Thank you!\n"
msgstr "Congratulations sa pagkumpleto ng \"General formulation of quantum information\" course ng IBM&reg;! Maglaan ng sandali upang tulungan kaming pahusayin ang aming course sa pamamagitan ng pagsagot sa sumusunod na [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Gagamitin ang iyong feedback upang mapahusay ang aming content offering at user experience. Salamat!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukan ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for General formulation of quantum information.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos kumpletuhin ang mga pagbabasa at aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM Training, kung saan maaari kang kumuha ng badging exam para sa General formulation of quantum information.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagsusulit ay binubuo ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama ang hindi bababa sa 16 para makapasa. Kapag nakakuha ka ng passing score, awtomatikong ipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo sa pagpaparehistro sa IBM Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking handa ka nang kumuha ng pagsusulit. Kung hindi ka makakakuha ng passing score sa dalawang pagtatangka, pansamantalang malo-lock ang pagsusulit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Paunawa: Ang mga pagsusulit na ito sa IBM Training site ay maaaring pansamantalang hindi available sa susunod na ilang araw, dahil sa maintenance.\n"

