# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "PAUNAWA: Gumagamit ang IBM ng mga serbisyo ng Credly, isang third-party data processor na awtorisado ng IBM at nakabase sa Estados Unidos, para tumulong sa pamamahala ng IBM Digital Badge program. Para maibigay sa iyo ang isang IBM Digital Badge, ang iyong personal na impormasyon (pangalan, email address, at badge na natanggap) ay ibabahagi sa Credly. Makakatanggap ka ng email notification mula sa Credly na may mga tagubilin para i-claim ang badge. Ginagamit ang iyong personal na impormasyon para maibigay ang iyong badge at para sa pag-uulat ng programa at mga layuning operasyonal. Maaaring ibahagi ng IBM ang personal na impormasyong nakolekta sa mga subsidiary ng IBM at sa mga third party sa buong mundo. Pamamahalaan ito nang naaayon sa mga gawi ng IBM sa privacy. Maaaring tingnan ang IBM Privacy Statement [dito.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
